":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107042","id":2931046320,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6utDew","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T14:39:29Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T14:39:29Z","body":"We could add more detail to the 2D batching section here: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/performance/gpu_optimization.html#d-batching\n\nOutlines use Polygons internally which cannot be batched together. So this behaviour is expected (from my perspective), but I agree that as a user it is surprising that changing a setting suddenly breaks batching","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2931046320/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2931365207","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107042#issuecomment-2931365207","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107042","id":2931365207,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uuRVX","user":{"login":"Visense6","id":52338846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzM4ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52338846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Visense6","html_url":"https://github.com/Visense6","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Visense6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Visense6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Visense6/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Visense6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Visense6/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Visense6/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Visense6/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Visense6/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Visense6/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T15:55:13Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T15:55:13Z","body":"> We could add more detail to the 2D batching section here: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/performance/gpu_optimization.html#d-batching\n> \n> Outlines use Polygons internally which cannot be batched together. So this behaviour is expected (from my perspective), but I agree that as a user it is surprising that changing a setting suddenly breaks batching\n\nWhen I draw a grid of moves or abilities in a Fire Emblem-like strategy game of chess, the performance is even more disastrous, which is why I care so much about this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2931365207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/i